"(names_url)s\">ບໍລິການຊື່ (Name Services)</a> ຂອງລະບົບ."

#: plinth/modules/ejabberd/templates/ejabberd.html:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your XMPP server domain is not set. You can setup your domain on the system "
"<a href=\"%(names_url)s\">Name Services</a> page."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດເມນເຊີເວີ XMPP ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດເມນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ <a href=\"%"
"(names_url)s\">ບໍລິການຊື່ (Name Services)</a> ຂອງລະບົບ."

#: plinth/modules/email/__init__.py:26
msgid ""
"This is a complete email server solution using Postfix, Dovecot, and Rspamd. "
"Postfix sends and receives emails. Dovecot allows email clients to access "
"your mailbox using IMAP and POP3. Rspamd deals with spam."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີແກ້ໄຂເຊີເວີອີເມລທີ່ສົມບູນໂດຍໃຊ້ Postfix, Dovecot, ແລະ Rspamd. Postfix ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງ ແ"
"ລະ ຮັບອີເມລ. Dovecot ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ອີເມລໄຄເອັນເຂົ້າເຖິງກ່ອງຈົດໝາຍຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ IMAP ແລະ POP3. "
"Rspamd ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຈັດການສະແປມ (spam)."

#: plinth/modules/email/__init__.py:30
msgid ""
"Email server currently does not work with many free domain services "
"including those provided by the FreedomBox Foundation. Many ISPs also "
"restrict outgoing email. Some lift the restriction after an explicit "
"request. See manual page for more information."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນ ເຊີເວີອີເມລຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບບໍລິການໂດເມນຟຣີຫຼາຍແຫ່ງ ລວມທັງໂດເມນທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ "
"FreedomBox Foundation. ISP ຫຼາຍແຫ່ງຍັງຈໍາກັດການສົ່ງອີເມລອອກ. ບາງແຫ່ງອາດຈະຍົກເລີກການຈໍາກັດຫຼັ"
"ງຈາກມີການຮ້ອງຂໍຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ. ເບິ່ງໜ້າຄູ່ມືສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: plinth/modules/email/__init__.py:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each user on {box_name} gets an email address like user@mydomain.example. "
"They will also receive mail from all addresses that look like "
"user+foo@mydomain.example. Further, they can add aliases to their email "
"address. Necessary aliases such as \"postmaster\" are automatically created "
"pointing to the first admin user."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນໃນ {box_name} ຈະໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລເຊັ່ນ user@mydomain.example. ພວກເຂົາຍັງຈະໄດ້ຮັບເ"
"ມລຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ user+foo@mydomain.example. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກເຂົາຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມຊື່ແຝ"
"ງ (alias) ໃຫ້ກັບທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້. ຊື່ແຝງທີ່ຈໍາເປັນເຊັ່ນ \"postmaster\" ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະ"
"ໂນມັດ ໂດຍຊີ້ໄປຫາຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຄົນທຳອິດ."

#: plinth/modules/email/__init__.py:41
msgid ""
"<a href=\"/freedombox/apps/roundcube/\">Roundcube app</a> provides web "
"interface for users to access email."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"/freedombox/apps/roundcube/\">ແອັບ Roundcube</a> ສະໜອງເວັບອິນເຕີເຟດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃ"
"ຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອີເມລ."

#: plinth/modules/email/__init__.py:43
