#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_feedback.html:18
msgid ""
"Let us know about missing features, your favourite apps and how we can "
"improve them on our <a href=\"https://discuss.freedombox.org\" "
"target=\"_blank\"> discussion forum</a>."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບຟີເຈີທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ, ແອັບທີ່ທ່ານມັກ ແລະ ວິທີທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະປັບປຸງພວກມັນໄດ້ໃນ <a "
"href=\"https://discuss.freedombox.org\" target=\"_blank\"> ຟໍຣຳສົນທະນາ</a> ຂອງພ"
"ວກເຮົາ."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_feedback.html:26
msgid ""
"If you find any bugs or issues, please use the <a href=\"https://"
"salsa.debian.org/freedombox-team/freedombox/issues\" target=\"_blank\">issue "
"tracker</a> to let our developers know. To report, first check if the issue "
"is already reported and then use the \"New issue\" button."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ບັນຫາໃດໆ, ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ <a href=\"https://salsa.debian.org/"
"freedombox-team/freedombox/issues\" target=\"_blank\">ລະບົບຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ (issue "
"tracker)</a> ເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາຂອງພວກເຮົາຊາບ. ກ່ອນຈະລາຍງານ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງກ່ອນວ່າບັນຫານັ້ນມີຄົ"
"ນລາຍງານໄປແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ \"New issue\"."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_feedback.html:36
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "ຂອບໃຈ!"

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_index.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The <a href=\"%(manual_url)s\">%(box_name)s Manual</a> is the best place to "
"start for information regarding %(box_name)s."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(manual_url)s\">ຄູ່ມື %(box_name)s</a> ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັ"
"ບ %(box_name)s."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_index.html:25
#, python-format
