"%(box_name)s </a> ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_index.html:32
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To seek help from %(box_name)s community, queries may be posted on the <a "
"href=\"https://lists.alioth.debian.org/mailman/listinfo/freedombox-"
"discuss\"> mailing list</a>.  The list archives also contain information "
"about problems faced by other users and possible solutions."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຊຸມຊົນ %(box_name)s, ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳຖາມໄປຫາ <a href=\"https://"
"lists.alioth.debian.org/mailman/listinfo/freedombox-discuss\"> ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຮັບອີເມວ "
"(mailing list)</a>. ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າຍັງປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆເຄີຍພົບ ແລະ ວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເປັ"
"ນໄປໄດ້."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_index.html:42
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Many %(box_name)s contributors and users are also available on the "
"irc.oftc.net IRC network.  Join and request help on the <a href=\"https://"
"webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&channels=freedombox&prompt=1\"> #freedombox</"
"a> channel using the IRC web interface."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ %(box_name)s ຫຼາຍທ່ານ ຍັງປະຈຳການຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IRC ຂອງ "
"irc.oftc.net. ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ ແລະ ຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໄດ້ທີ່ຊ່ອງ <a href=\"https://"
"webchat.oftc.net/?randomnick=1&amp;channels=freedombox&amp;prompt=1\"> "
"#freedombox</a> ໂດຍຜ່ານເວັບໄຊທ໌ IRC."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_manual.html:19
msgid "Download as PDF"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດເປັນ PDF"

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_support.html:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you need help in getting something done or if you are facing problems "
"using %(box_name)s, you can ask for help from our community of users and "
"contributors."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການເຮັດບາງຢ່າງ ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານພົບບັນຫາໃນການນຳໃຊ້ %(box_name)s, ທ່ານສ"
"າມາດຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຊຸມຊົນຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຜູ້ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_support.html:20
msgid ""
"Search for past discussions or post a new query on our <a href=\"https://"
"discuss.freedombox.org\" target=\"_blank\">discussion forum</a>."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາການສົນທະນາໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄຳຖາມໃໝ່ໃນ <a href=\"https://discuss.freedombox.org\" "
"target=\"_blank\">ເວັບບອດສົນທະນາ</a> ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: plinth/modules/help/templates/help_support.html:27
msgid ""
"You can also chat with us on our IRC and Matrix channels (bridged): <ul> "
"<li>#freedombox on irc.oftc.net</li> <li>#freedombox:matrix.org</li> </ul> "
"Or send an email to our <a href=\"mailto:freedombox-discuss@alioth-"
"lists.debian.net\">mailing list</a>."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສົນທະນາກັບພວກເຮົາຜ່ານຊ່ອງ IRC ແລະ Matrix (ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ): <ul> <li>"
"#freedombox ໃນ irc.oftc.net</li> <li>#freedombox:matrix.org</li> </ul> ຫຼື ສົ່ງອີເ"
"ມວຫາ <a href=\"mailto:freedombox-discuss@alioth-lists.debian.net\">ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຮັບອີເມ"
"ວ</a> ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

