msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:116 plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:155
msgid "DNS Server"
msgstr "DNS ເຊີເວີ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:117
msgid ""
"Optional value. If this value is given and IPv4 addressing method is "
"\"Automatic\", the DNS Servers provided by a DHCP server will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ຖ້າກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ ແລະ ວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ເປັນ \"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ\", DNS ເຊີເວີ ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"DHCP ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:122 plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:161
msgid "Second DNS Server"
msgstr "DNS ເຊີເວີ ຕົວທີສອງ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:123
msgid ""
"Optional value. If this value is given and IPv4 Addressing Method is "
"\"Automatic\", the DNS Servers provided by a DHCP server will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ຖ້າກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ ແລະ ວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ເປັນ \"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ\", DNS ເຊີເວີ ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"DHCP ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:128
msgid "IPv6 Addressing Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:130
msgid ""
"Automatic: Configure automatically, use Internet connection from this network"
msgstr "ອັດຕະໂນມັດ: ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເນັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:133
msgid ""
"Automatic (DHCP only): Configure automatically, use Internet connection from "
"this network"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (DHCP ເທົ່ານັ້ນ): ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເນັດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:136
msgid ""
"Link-local: Configure automatically to use an address that is only relevant "
"to this network."
msgstr ""
"Link-local: ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ມີຜົນສະເພາະພາຍໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:141
msgid "Ignore: Ignore this addressing method"
msgstr "ລະເລີຍ: ລະເລີຍວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:142
msgid "Disabled: Disable IPv6 for this connection"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ: ປິດໃຊ້ IPv6 ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:147
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Prefix"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:148
msgid "Value between 1 and 128."
msgstr "ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 128."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:156
msgid ""
"Optional value. If this value is given and IPv6 addressing method is "
"\"Automatic\", the DNS Servers provided by a DHCP server will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ຖ້າກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ ແລະ ວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ເປັນ \"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ\", DNS ເຊີເວີ ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"DHCP ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:162
msgid ""
"Optional value. If this value is given and IPv6 Addressing Method is "
"\"Automatic\", the DNS Servers provided by a DHCP server will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ຖ້າກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ ແລະ ວິທີການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ເປັນ \"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ\", DNS ເຊີເວີ ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"DHCP ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:183
msgid "-- select --"
msgstr "-- ເລືອກ --"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:312
#: plinth/modules/networks/templates/connection_show.html:140
msgid "SSID"
msgstr "SSID"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:313
msgid "The visible name of the network."
msgstr "ຊື່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:315
#: plinth/modules/networks/templates/connection_show.html:153
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:315
msgid "Infrastructure"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານໂຄງລ່າງ (Infrastructure)"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:316
msgid "Access Point"
msgstr "ຈຸດກະຈາຍສັນຍານ (Access Point)"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:317
msgid "Ad-hoc"
msgstr "Ad-hoc"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:319
msgid "Frequency Band"
msgstr "ຄື້ນຄວາມຖີ່"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:320
msgid "A (5 GHz)"
msgstr "A (5 GHz)"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:321
msgid "B/G (2.4 GHz)"
msgstr "B/G (2.4 GHz)"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:323
#: plinth/modules/networks/templates/connection_show.html:167
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:324
msgid ""
"Optional value. Wireless channel in the selected frequency band to restrict "
"to. Blank or 0 value means automatic selection."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ຊ່ອງສັນຍານໄຮ້ສາຍໃນຄື້ນຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ເລືອກ. ຖ້າປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຫຼື ໃສ່ຄ່າ 0 ໝາຍເຖິງການເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕ"
"ະໂນມັດ."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:329
msgid "BSSID"
msgstr "BSSID"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:330
msgid ""
"Optional value. Unique identifier for the access point. When connecting to "
"an access point, connect only if the BSSID of the access point matches the "
"one provided. Example: 00:11:22:aa:bb:cc."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ. ລະຫັດລະບຸສະເພາະຂອງຈຸດກະຈາຍສັນຍານ. ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາຈຸດກະຈາຍສັນຍານ, ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ "
"BSSID ຂອງຈຸດນັ້ນກົງກັບຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: 00:11:22:aa:bb:cc."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:336
msgid "Authentication Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:337
msgid ""
"Select WPA if the wireless network is secured and requires clients to have "
"the password to connect."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ WPA ຖ້າເຄືອຂ່າຍໄຮ້ສາຍມີຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃສ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:339
msgid "WPA"
msgstr "WPA"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:339
msgid "Open"
msgstr "ເປີດ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:375
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Specify how your {box_name} is connected to your network"
msgstr "ລະບຸວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {box_name} ຂອງທ່ານກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:382
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Connected to a router <p class=\"help-block\">Your {box_name} gets its "
"Internet connection from your router via Wi-Fi or Ethernet cable. This is a "
"typical home setup.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຣາວເຕີ <p class=\"help-block\">{box_name} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດຈາກຣ"
"າວເຕີຜ່ານ Wi-Fi ຫຼື ສາຍ Ethernet. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບເຮືອນ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:389
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{box_name} is your router <p class=\"help-block\">Your {box_name} has "
"multiple network interfaces such as multiple Ethernet ports or a Wi-Fi "
"adapter. {box_name} is directly connected to the Internet and all your "
"devices connect to {box_name} for their Internet connectivity.</p>"
msgstr ""
"{box_name} ແມ່ນຣາວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ <p class=\"help-block\">{box_name} ຂອງທ່ານມີຊ່ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເ"
"ຄືອຂ່າຍຫຼາຍຊ່ອງ ເຊັ່ນ ຊ່ອງ Ethernet ຫຼາຍຊ່ອງ ຫຼື ຕົວຮັບສັນຍານ Wi-Fi. {box_name} ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນ"
"ເຕີເນັດໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {box_name} ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານອິນເຕີເນັດ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:398
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Directly connected to the Internet <p class=\"help-block\">Your Internet "
"connection is directly attached to your {box_name} and there are no other "
"devices on the network. This can happen on community or cloud setups.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນເຕີເນັດໂດຍກົງ <p class=\"help-block\">ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນຕໍ່ໃສ່ກັບ "
"{box_name} ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີອຸປະກອນອື່ນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຊຸມຊົນ ຫຼື ຄລາ"
"ວ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:417
msgid "Choose your internet connection type"
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງທ່ານ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:421
msgid ""
"I have a public IP address that may change over time<p class=\"help-"
"block\">This means that devices on the Internet can reach you when you are "
"connected to the Internet. Every time you connect to the Internet with your "
"Internet Service Provider (ISP), you may get a different IP address, "
"especially after some offline time. Many ISPs offer this type of "
"connectivity. If you have a public IP address but are unsure if it changes "
"over time or not, it is safer to choose this option.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະທີ່ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ <p class=\"help-block\">ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອຸປະກອ"
"ນຕ່າງໆໃນອິນເຕີເນັດສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ຫາທ່ານໄດ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດກັບຜູ້"
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (ISP), ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫຼັງຈາກປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປໄລຍະໜຶ່"
"ງ. ISP ຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ປະເພດນີ້. ຖ້າທ່ານມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະແຕ່ບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນປ່ຽນແປງຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ມັນຈະປອດໄພກວ່າຖ້າເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:433
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"I have a public IP address that does not change over time (recommended)<p "
"class=\"help-block\">This means that devices on the Internet can reach you "
"when you are connected to the Internet. Every time you connect to the "
"Internet with your Internet Service Provider (ISP), you always get the same "
"IP address. This is the most trouble-free setup for many {box_name} services "
"but very few ISPs offer this. You may be able to get this service from your "
"ISP by making an additional payment.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະທີ່ບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ (ແນະນຳ) <p class=\"help-block\">ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອຸ"
"ປະກອນຕ່າງໆໃນອິນເຕີເນັດສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ຫາທ່ານໄດ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັ"
"ດກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (ISP), ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ເດີມສະເໝີ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສະດວກທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການບໍລິການຕ່າ"
"ງໆຂອງ {box_name} ແຕ່ມີ ISP ໜ້ອຍແຫ່ງທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການນີ້. ທ່ານອາດຈະສາມາດຂໍບໍລິການນີ້ຈາກ ISP ໂດຍການຈ່"
"າຍຄ່າບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:446
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"I dont have a public IP address<p class=\"help-block\">This means that "
"devices on the Internet <b>can not</b> reach you when you are connected to "
"the Internet. Every time you connect to the Internet with your Internet "
"Service Provider (ISP), you get an IP address that is only relevant for "
"local networks. Many ISPs offer this type of connectivity. This is the most "
"troublesome situation for hosting services at home. {box_name} provides many "
"workaround solutions but each solution has some limitations.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະ <p class=\"help-block\">ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອຸປະກອນຕ່າງໆໃນອິນເຕີເນັດ <b>"
"ບໍ່ສາມາດ</b> ຕິດຕໍ່ຫາທ່ານໄດ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ "
"(ISP), ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະພາຍໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ISP ຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການການເ"
"ຊື່ອມຕໍ່ປະເພດນີ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະການທີ່ຫຍຸ້ງຍາກທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການເປີດໃຫ້ບໍລິການເຊີເວີຢູ່ເຮືອນ. {box_name} ມີວິທີ"
"ແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ແຕ່ແຕ່ລະວິທີກໍມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:459
msgid ""
"I do not know the type of connection my ISP provides <p class=\"help-"
"block\">You will be suggested the most conservative actions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້ປະເພດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ ISP ຂອງຂ້ອຍໃຫ້ບໍລິການ <p class=\"help-block\">ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແນະ"
"ນຳວິທີການທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ສຸດ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:476
msgid "Preferred router configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຣາວເຕີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:481
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use DMZ feature to forward all traffic (recommended) <p class=\"help-"
"block\">Most routers provide a configuration setting called DMZ. This will "
"allow the router to forward all incoming traffic from the Internet to a "
"single IP address such as the {box_name}'s IP address. First remember to "
"configure a static local IP address for your {box_name} in your router's "
"configuration.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ DMZ ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ (ແນະນຳ) <p class=\"help-block\">ຣາວເຕີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຣາວເຕີສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຂົ້າມາຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດໄປຍັງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວ ເຊັ່ນ ທີ່ຢູ່ "
"IP ຂອງ {box_name}. ກ່ອນອື່ນ ຢ່າລືມຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ IP ພາຍໃນແບບຄົງທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບ {box_name} ຂອງທ່ານໃນການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຣາວເຕີ.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:493
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Forward specific traffic as needed by each application <p class=\"help-"
"block\">You may alternatively choose to forward only specific traffic to "
"your {box_name}. This is ideal if you have other servers like {box_name} in "
"your network or if your router does not support DMZ feature. All "
"applications that provide a web interface need you to forward traffic from "
"ports 80 and 443 to work. Each of the other applications will suggest which "
"port(s) need to be forwarded for that application to work.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງແຕ່ລະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ <p class=\"help-block\">ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອ"
"ກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະບາງຢ່າງໄປຍັງ {box_name} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີຖ້າທ່ານມີເຊີເວີອື່ນໆຄືກັບ "
"{box_name} ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ຖ້າຣາວເຕີຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດ DMZ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໜ້າເ"
"ວັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກພອດ 80 ແລະ 443 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ແຕ່ລະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆຈ"
"ະແນະນຳວ່າຕ້ອງສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດໃດແດ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.</p>"

#: plinth/modules/networks/forms.py:507
msgid ""
"Router is currently unconfigured <p class=\"help-block\">Choose this if you "
"have not configured or are unable to configure the router currently and wish "
"to be reminded later. Some of the other configuration steps may fail.</p>"
msgstr ""
"ຣາວເຕີຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຕອນນີ້ <p class=\"help-block\">ເລືອກຂໍ້ນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້"
"ງຄ່າຣາວເຕີໄດ້ໃນຕອນນີ້ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຕືອນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ບາງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆອາດຈະບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.</p>"

