#: plinth/modules/openvpn/templates/openvpn.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To connect to %(box_name)s's VPN, you need to download a profile and feed it "
"to an OpenVPN client on your mobile or desktop machine. OpenVPN Clients are "
"available for most platforms. Click \"Learn more...\" above for recommended "
"clients and instructions on how to configure them."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ VPN ຂອງ %(box_name)s, ທ່ານຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບ OpenVPN "
"client ໃນມືຖື ຫຼື ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ. OpenVPN Client ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນເກືອບທຸກແພລັດຟອມ. ຄລິກ \"ສຶກ"
"ສາເພີ່ມເຕີມ...\" ທາງເທິງເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

