#: plinth/modules/performance/__init__.py:19
msgid ""
"Performance app allows you to collect, store and view information about "
"utilization of the hardware. This can give you basic insights into usage "
"patterns and whether the hardware is overloaded by users and services."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບປະສິດທິພາບຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເກັບກຳ, ຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການນຳໃຊ້ຮາດແວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່"
"ານເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ຮູ້ວ່າຮາດແວຖືກໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍເກີນໄປຫຼືບໍ່."

#: plinth/modules/performance/__init__.py:23
msgid ""
"Performance metrics are collected by Performance Co-Pilot and can be viewed "
"using the Cockpit app."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນປະສິດທິພາບແມ່ນຖືກເກັບກຳໂດຍ Performance Co-Pilot ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຜ່ານແອັບ Cockpit."

#: plinth/modules/performance/manifest.py:18
