#: plinth/modules/quassel/__init__.py:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Quassel is an IRC application that is split into two parts, a \"core\" and a "
"\"client\". This allows the core to remain connected to IRC servers, and to "
"continue receiving messages, even when the client is disconnected. "
"{box_name} can run the Quassel core service keeping you always online and "
"one or more Quassel clients from a desktop or a mobile can be used to "
"connect and disconnect from it."
msgstr ""
"Quassel ແມ່ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ IRC ທີ່ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງສ່ວນ ຄື \"ສ່ວນຫຼັກ\" (core) ແລະ \"ສ່ວນຜູ້ໃ"
"ຊ້\" (client). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ່ວນຫຼັກສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ IRC ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລະ ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ເຖິງ"
"ແມ່ນວ່າສ່ວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວກໍຕາມ. {box_name} ສາມາດເປີດນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການ Quassel core ເ"
"ພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານອອນລາຍຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໂດຍທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ Quassel client ຈາກຄອມພິວເຕີ ຫຼື ມືຖື ເພື່ອເຊື່"
"ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກມັນໄດ້."

#: plinth/modules/quassel/__init__.py:31
msgid ""
"You can connect to your Quassel core on the default Quassel port 4242.  "
"Clients to connect to Quassel from your <a href=\"http://quassel-irc.org/"
"downloads\">desktop</a> and <a href=\"http://quasseldroid.iskrembilen.com/"
"\">mobile</a> devices are available."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Quassel core ຜ່ານພອດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 4242. ສາມາດໃຊ້ client ສຳລັບ <a "
"href=\"http://quassel-irc.org/downloads\">ຄອມພິວເຕີ</a> ແລະ <a href=\"http://"
"quasseldroid.iskrembilen.com/\">ມືຖື</a> ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

