#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:16
msgid ""
"Choose a username and password to access this web interface. The password "
"can be changed later. This user will be granted administrative privileges. "
"Other users can be added later."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜ່ານເວັບນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ ພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຈ"
"ະໄດ້ຮັບສິດໃນການຈັດການລະບົບ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໄດ້ພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:29
msgid "Create Account"
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີ"

#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:38
msgid "An administrator account already exists."
msgstr "ມີບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:45
msgid "The following administrator accounts exist in the system."
msgstr "ມີບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ."

#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:57
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Delete these accounts from command line and refresh the page to create an "
"account that is usable with %(box_name)s. On the command line run the "
"command \"echo '{\"args\": [\"USERNAME\", \"AUTH_USER\", \"AUTH_PASSWORD\"], "
"\"kwargs\": {}}' | sudo freedombox-cmd users remove_user\". If an account is "
"already usable with %(box_name)s, skip this step."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບບັນຊີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໜ້າຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບ %(box_name)s. ຢູ່"
"ທີ່ບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ \"echo '{\"args\": [\"USERNAME\", \"AUTH_USER\", "
"\"AUTH_PASSWORD\"], \"kwargs\": {}}' | sudo freedombox-cmd users "
"remove_user\". ຖ້າບັນຊີສາມາດໃຊ້ງານກັບ %(box_name)s ໄດ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄປ."

#: plinth/modules/users/templates/users_firstboot.html:70
msgid "Skip this step"
msgstr "ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້"

