#: plinth/modules/wireguard/__init__.py:20
msgid "WireGuard is a fast, modern, secure VPN tunnel."
msgstr "WireGuard ແມ່ນອຸໂມງ VPN ທີ່ໄວ, ທັນສະໄໝ ແລະ ປອດໄພ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/__init__.py:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It can be used to connect to a VPN provider which supports WireGuard, and to "
"route all outgoing traffic from {box_name} through the VPN."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ VPN ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ WireGuard ແລະ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຈາກ {box_name} "
"ຜ່ານ VPN."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/__init__.py:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A second use case is to connect a mobile device to {box_name} while "
"travelling. While connected to a public Wi-Fi network, all traffic can be "
"securely relayed through {box_name}."
msgstr ""
"ອີກກໍລະນີໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມືຖືກັບ {box_name} ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເດີນທາງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ Wi-Fi ສາທາລະນ"
"ະ, ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານ {box_name} ຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:32
msgid "Invalid key."
msgstr "ຄີ (key) ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:63
msgid "Not a valid IP address."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:69
#: plinth/modules/wireguard/templates/wireguard.html:29
#: plinth/modules/wireguard/templates/wireguard.html:57
#: plinth/modules/wireguard/templates/wireguard.html:125
#: plinth/modules/wireguard/templates/wireguard_auto_add_client.html:24
#: plinth/modules/wireguard/templates/wireguard_delete_server.html:24
msgid "Public Key"
msgstr "Public Key"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:70
msgid ""
"Public key of the peer. Example: "
"MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."
msgstr ""
"Public key ຂອງຄູ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (peer). ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:83
msgid "Endpoint of the server"
msgstr "Endpoint ຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:84
msgid ""
"Domain name and port in the form \"ip:port\". Example: "
"demo.wireguard.com:12912 ."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂດເມນ ແລະ ພອດ ໃນຮູບແບບ \"ip:port\". ຕົວຢ່າງ: demo.wireguard.com:12912 ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:89
msgid "Public key of the server"
msgstr "Public key ຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:90
msgid ""
"Provided by the server operator, a long string of characters. Example: "
"MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ມາຈາກຜູ້ດູແລເຊີເວີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:95
msgid "Client IP address provided by server"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງຕົວໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊີເວີກຳນົດໃຫ້"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:97
msgid ""
"IP address assigned to this machine on the VPN after connecting to the "
"endpoint. This value is usually provided by the server operator. Example: "
"192.168.0.10 or 2a03:7c80:4b2c:91a2:5d41:ffee:9b82:7c17. You can also "
"specify the network. This will allow reaching machines in the network. "
"Examples: 10.68.12.43/24 or 10.68.12.43/255.255.255.0."
msgstr ""
"ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງນີ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ VPN ຫຼັງຈາກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກຜູ້ດູແລເຊີເວີ. ຕົວ"
"ຢ່າງ: 192.168.0.10 ຫຼື 2a03:7c80:4b2c:91a2:5d41:ffee:9b82:7c17. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ ເຄື"
"ອຂ່າຍ (network) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງອື່ນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ 10.68.12.43/24."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:106
msgid "Private key of this machine"
msgstr "Private key ຂອງເຄື່ອງນີ້"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:107
msgid ""
"Optional. New public/private keys are generated if left blank. Public key "
"can then be provided to the server. This is the recommended way. However, "
"some server operators insist on providing this. Example: "
"MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ. ຫາກປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຄີໃໝ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳ. ແຕ່ຜູ້ດູແລເຊີເວີບາງຄົນ"
"ອາດຈະເປັນຄົນກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs= ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:115
msgid "Pre-shared key"
msgstr "Pre-shared key"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:116
msgid ""
"Optional. A shared secret key provided by the server to add an additional "
"layer of security. Fill in only if provided. Example: "
"MConEJFIg6+DFHg2J1nn9SNLOSE9KR0ysdPgmPjibEs=."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ. ແມ່ນຄີລັບທີ່ເຊີເວີໃຫ້ມາເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພອີກຊັ້ນໜຶ່ງ. ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຫາກໄດ້ຮັບມາເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:122
msgid "Use this connection to send all outgoing traffic"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອອກທັງໝົດ"

#: plinth/modules/wireguard/forms.py:124
msgid "Typically checked for a VPN service through which all traffic is sent."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເລືອກສຳລັບບໍລິການ VPN ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຜ່ານນັ້ນ."

